# tally 2.2.1, 221.R1 (L §5.18 l.1603: residuals x span, "x a place"): the ledger of a place of a
# unit of kind one runs, no LOAD-UNIT. A guard: both interpreters so.
=== t221r1.tally
model t221r1
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit share "one share"
kind lots: place share min 0
place pile: lots lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input n: num share
input db: date
move buy: transfers
  on db
  leg cash from world to pile amount n
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  n = 3 share "s"
  db = 2026-03-10 "s"
  opening[pile] = 0 share at 2026-01-01 start "s"
ask r: residuals pile 2026-03
=== expect
r: residuals pile 2026-03
  cut 2026-06-10
